The task is to set the description of all high-priority, at-risk projects with the Meridian milestone due December 2, 2026 to 'Pivoting to usage-based pricing'.

I need to find projects that satisfy the following conditions:
1. High priority
2. "At risk" - this is probably a label
3. Have the "Meridian" milestone due December 2, 2026

Then set each project's description to 'Pivoting to usage-based pricing'.

Let me start by querying projects. The Linear API has a `projects` query. Let me check what fields are available. I'll try the query:

```graphql
query {
  projects(first: 50) {
    nodes {
      id
      name
      description
      priority
      milestone {
        id
        name
        targetDate
      }
      labels(first: 50) {
        nodes {
          name
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Also, "at-risk" might be a status or a label. Let me also check the labels.

Let me run the first query.

